{"id":"vod_sn_35916","vodId":"35916","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"甜梦猫","name_cn":"甜梦猫","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ae086a726b0e55b1d74911e97da804c6.jpg"},"summary":"甜梦猫是浅紫罗兰色的小猫玩偶，由住在天上的世界、身为布偶工匠的妖精们所制造。一天，甜梦猫从天上掉下来，被一个人类女孩拾起并带回家。女孩每天都抱起甜梦猫，与她说话；甜梦猫为了表达她的谢意，向月亮许愿，然后她的耳朵里的星星斑纹被月光照亮，发出光芒，就变得能够说话了。女孩与甜梦猫于是每天都一起谈话，而且晚上一起睡觉会发一样的梦，在梦中一起玩耍、一起聊小秘密......","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":48,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BQsvvRxciR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qqTewHeKfb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EPT2UsRQiD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TXRMRVBAGT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JTUqdwVBjX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Xx0CKUXem31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ip9hEmp6yX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iSvx4rzp5m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rcJEDYcgCN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XU9bwcfMA91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M4HYq4YJdd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/241gJi5mVK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pMKtqi0Nn91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A6Xbwjg5v51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RUcMJRJCmP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://v6.rstu6